---

This directory vendors `idevice-ffi` (the C/FFI bindings for the `idevice`
crate, https://github.com/jkcoxson/idevice, BSD-3-Clause) at the pinned
revision used by SideInstaller:
  7bd551c16c6dd2e058740d85a2d9399a51a776e9

The additional engine module `src/pairable_host_run.rs` (exposing
`si_run_host` / `si_result_free`) is an independent reimplementation against
the public `idevice::remote_pairing` API and is also released under the
BSD-3-Clause terms above.
